            "review_title": "Review at Gang Yu Hot Pot",
            "review_text": "Ben\nSingapore, Singapore15 contributions\n0\nGreat Place to Eat\nJan 2025 • Family\nWhen I first saw others review, I was concerned that the restaurant only serve spicy soup. However, I saw the menu and was glad that they many other soup broth to choose that is not spicy soup. I have the tomato based soup. It was awesome. \n\nI was also worried that ordering my food will be a problem as I can speak Vietnamese or Chinese. To my surprise, a very friendly service staff, Ms Thảo Nhi, came to take our order as well as able to communicate other languages and even provide an English version menu.\n\nThe food was great as well as the service staffs. It was a great experience and my entire family had a great time. I will definitely come back to eat if I come visit Danang again.\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2025",
